  "body": "The ASVS already includes some guidelines that would only take effect if a security breach or mishap has happened before, like not storing plain text passwords in the sourcecode. (Users shouldn't be able to see the sourcecode anyway, so this is a non-issue unless you already had a security problem)\r\n\r\nI was wondering if backups should be included in the scope of the ASVS as well?",
